From 893c4c5cd482058b3eaa4c2c1711029de0cec9f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dev <dev@example.local>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:27:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add 'Recently viewed' panel to the sidebar navigation

Track the last 10 files opened in the viewer via RecentlyViewedService
(persisted in localStorage) and list them in the expanded sidenav with
icon, name and relative time. Clicking an item opens the file in the viewer.
Includes i18n strings and unit tests for the service, component and preview hook.
